[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mReturn it from login (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mKeep login(username, password); add userId to the returned object and log/track it from the result. Identity comes
[39m     [38;5;246mout of authentication, not into it.[39m
